// External Port Scanner
//
// Scans your external IP for open/reachable ports.
//
// Browsers can't open raw TCP connections, so scans are performed by
// check-host.net's worldwide check nodes (each port is probed from 2
// independent locations), reached through the superFetch proxy to bypass
// CORS. Only scan hosts you own.

superFetch = {import:super-fetch-plugin}

$meta
  title = External Port Scanner
  description = Checks which ports are open and reachable from the internet on your external IP — spot exposed services and port-forwarding mistakes.
  tags = security, network, ports, scanner
